  message: "2026-10-25 (owner-requested note, from a review of how WI-ziruv and WI-kosup bear on the open concept-audit rows): WI-ziruv (falsify each declared axis's rule on real output)'s ADR-0061 row: ruling 2 can be tested as a metamorphic property: adding a community file never moves any verdict toward clean. This item (community trust honoured) is its counterexample, and that test is a natural closure test."  # a51a
